<!-- Section 2: Yearly Distribution -->
<div class="section">
  <h2>2. Year-by-Year Question Volume Analysis</h2>
  <p>The chart below shows the total number of questions set each examination year. A clear structural shift is visible starting from 2021, when the exam format expanded significantly.</p>

