<div class="container">

<!-- Section 1: Overview -->
<div class="section">
  <h2>1. Dataset &amp; Examination Overview</h2>
  <p>This analysis draws on <strong>{total_questions} examination questions</strong> spanning <strong>{len(year_range)} examination years</strong> (2015–2025, with 2020 absent). The dataset covers BIEK HSC Part-2 Computer Science Paper-II (theory) and includes three question formats: Multiple Choice Questions (MCQs), Short-answer Questions, and Long-answer/Essay Questions.</p>

  <div class="kpi-grid">
