  </ul>
</div>

<!-- Section 2: Yearly Distribution -->
<div class="section">
  <h2>2. Year-by-Year Question Volume Analysis</h2>
  <p>The chart below shows the total number of questions set each examination year. The data reveals a clear <strong>three-phase evolution</strong> rather than a simple linear trend.</p>

  <div class="chart-wrap">
    <img src="data:image/png;base64,{chart1_b64}" alt="Total Questions per Year">
